1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,341
Swap in silver.

2
00:00:01,341 --> 00:00:09,687
In a silver copper cell, copper is now the more easily oxidised metal, so copper becomes the anode and silver the cathode.

3
00:00:09,687 --> 00:00:15,638
Copper dissolves, silver deposits, and the cell gives zero point four six volts.

